Approach (Valid Palindrome)
Convert the string to lowercase so that uppercase and lowercase letters are treated the same.
Remove all non-alphanumeric characters (spaces, symbols, punctuation) using regex.
Use two pointers:
One pointer at the beginning (i)
One pointer at the end (j)
Compare characters at both pointers:
If equal → move both pointers (i++, j--)
If not equal → return false
If all characters match → return true

Type	Complexity
Time Complexity	O(n)
Space Complexity	O(n)
